{{ define "content" }}
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-8">
    <div>
      <span class="badge">Privacy</span>
      <h1 class="page-title mt-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">
        This page explains how Rising Star handles basic information when you
        use the website.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card space-y-6 text-sm leading-7 text-academic-700">
      <p>Last updated: Replace with your launch date.</p>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-academic-900">
          Information we collect
        </h2>
        <p>
          Students can browse public notes without creating an account. We may
          collect standard technical information such as IP address, browser
          type, device information, pages visited, and request timestamps
          through server logs and analytics tools.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-academic-900">Admin accounts</h2>
        <p>
          Admin users must sign in to manage content. For admin accounts, we
          store account details such as name, email address, password hash,
          role, and session data.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-academic-900">Cookies</h2>
        <p>
          This website uses cookies for admin sessions and security features
          such as CSRF protection. If advertising or analytics are enabled,
          third-party services may also use cookies according to their own
          policies.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-academic-900">Advertising</h2>
        <p>
          This website may display advertisements through Google AdSense or
          similar advertising services. These services may use cookies or
          similar technologies to serve and measure ads.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-academic-900">File access</h2>
        <p>
          Notes and files are stored privately and delivered through secure
          temporary links. The original private storage URL is not exposed to
          public users.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-academic-900">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For privacy questions, contact us at:
          <a href="mailto:your-email@example.com">your-email@example.com</a>
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </section>
{{ end }}
